And with that cash, you were tasked with going out into our incredibly expensive modern

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:32.740
world to purchase one full month of comprehensive, unlimited, life-saving health insurance.

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:33.740
Good luck with that.

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:34.740
Right.

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:40.100
I mean, and I don't just mean for some perfectly healthy, invincible 20-something who, you know,

