You take that $440 and you look absolutely anywhere in the continental United States.

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:04.940
Who in the state can find a comprehensive, unlimited health insurance plan for only $440

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:05.940
a month?

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.060
Well, it's practically a mathematical impossibility.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:14.020
I mean, if you look at the current market across the mainland United States, $440 might

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:18.180
get you, well, an incredibly bare-bones, catastrophic only plan.

