of data that says in Puerto Rico, this unbelievably tight budget is not just some theoretical

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:20.380
anomaly.

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:21.380
No.

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:24.780
It's the absolute unyielding reality of their entire healthcare system.

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:25.780
It's just wild.

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:31.180
And that specific reality, that incredibly tight margin, has birthed a very pervasive, very

